    <description>This packages provides metadata (.winmd) for the Windows Driver Kit (WDK). It is intended to be used as the basis for generating language-specific projections. It is not loadable as a CLR assembly.</description>
    <summary>This packages provides metadata (.winmd) for the Windows Driver Kit (WDK).</summary>
